      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results of 30 operations performed for combined lesions of coronary and peripheral arteries are analyzed. All the operations were performed as off-pump minimally invasive coronary surgery (MICS) on beating heart with \"Octopus\" system Medtromic. There were no lethal outcomes. Number of complications was minimal. MICS is high-effective procedure in selected patients with coronary heart disease. It is necessary to use differential policy of surgical treatment of coronary heart disease."},
